WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.940
Let's work hard again today.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.900
Yeah, thanks.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.320
What are we having for a snack today?

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.860
A chestnut manju I received.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.900
Chestnut manju!

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:19.410
Can I eat now?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.200
Let's eat later.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.310
I love chestnuts.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.230
I love deserts with chestnuts, 
rice with chestnuts...

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.440
They're great boiled in sugar and water,

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.940
but they're great just boiled.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.760
I love raw chestnuts, too!

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.640
Huh? Raw?

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.440
They're wonderfully simple and good.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.730
They're all crunchy.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:44.600
<b>She likes the
crust on pizza</b>

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.600
<i>Can you even eat chestnuts raw?</i>

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.940
I want to eat some chestnuts...

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.950
I want to go outside and pick some chestnuts.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:53.190
Okay, okay. Anyway, let's get to work.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.650
Okay...

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.170
<i>It's rather impressive...</i>

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>Once she gets started—once 
she starts focusing—</i>

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.050
<i>it's like she's able to 
shut everything else out.</i>

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:15.010
<i>She doesn't think about anything but work.</i>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.060
<i>Chestnuts...</i>

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:19.970
<i>Chestnuts...!</i>

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:23.470
<i>Chestnuts!</i>

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:27.970
<i>The first demon, Beelzebub!</i>

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:27.970
<b>Beelzebub</b>

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:33.980
The first demon

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:30.000
<i>I wish I was born in the beginning times,</i>

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:33.980
Drum, drum, drum!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.980
<i>and could pick chestnuts all day.</i>

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.930
<i>Beelzebub doesn't wake 
up early in the morning,</i>

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:09.710
<i>but not too late, either.</i>

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.210
<i>She wakes up...</i>

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:13.940
<i>Fluffy.</i>

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.130
<i>She showers...</i>

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.590
<i>Dries her hair...</i>

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:22.310
<i>Has a light breakfast...</i>

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:24.550
<i>Fluffy.</i>

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.890
<i>Puts on her heels...</i>

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.850
<i>Stands tall...</i>

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.540
<i>Gets her mind into gear...</i>

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.900
<i>And then goes to work.</i>

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.420
Good morning, Your Highness.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.360
Good morning, Mullin.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:49.370
<b>9 Centimeters.</b>

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.720
In any event, Your Highness, 
here is today's schedule.

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.800
We have documents to 
handle in the morning.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:58.120
We'll continue signing documents in your 
office during the afternoon, as well.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:00.170
Your Highness?

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.100
My heel got caught in the gap.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:07.230
I was being careful, but I still...

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.890
Hold on a second.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.440
This is rather stuck.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.540
It's fine!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.610
It's fine, I'll get it out myself.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.410
H-Hold on a second!

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:28.180
Why?!

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.450
You can't walk like this.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:36.200
<i>What should we do...</i>

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.170
<i>We need to get the office.</i>

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.970
<i>I guess I can head back 
to get new shoes for her.</i>

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:43.950
<i>But I can't just leave her here.</i>

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.680
Excuse me!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.980
<i>All right. Now I can take her with me.</i>

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:52.470
Wait...

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.810
Mullin, what are you...

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:59.070
I'm sorry! I can't do that!

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.360
You were too close!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.250
<i>He had thought he had 
made up his mind, but...</i>

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:04.920
I'm sorry.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.110
Could I carry you on my back instead?

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:07.280
Huh?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:11.080
But I can't have people around 
here seeing me like that...

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:14.000
As the leader of Pandemonium,

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.360
I must look strong while 
outside of my office...

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:19.080
But we need to get you out of here...

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:23.020
<i>I'll be fine if I just don't look.</i>

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.790
Okay...

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:33.040
Sorry, I really can't do this!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:33.950
What's going on?

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:34.930
They're so massive!

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.100
<i>What will he do?</i>

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.820
<i>They managed to make it 
to her office, somehow.</i>

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.740
<i>These don't feel right.</i>

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:51.600
I'm surprised you can walk with these heels.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.630
They're pretty thin, too.

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:57.330
It's like being on your tiptoes the 
whole time wearing heals, right?

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:00.960
Maybe we could glue this back on...

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.420
Please don't.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:05.880
They aren't something I <i>need</i> to wear,

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.450
but I like wearing heels.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.390
I guess it requires a bit 
of acrobatics to handle.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.830
Maybe you could easily walk with stilts now?

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.480
Are you making fun of me?

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.900
Excuse me!

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:26.320
Your Highness, I've finished the first 
fitting for your new ceremonial outfit.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.360
I'd like you to try it on.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.280
Who is this?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:35.910
This is Adrammelech.
He's in charge of my clothing.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:42.130
<b>Apparel and
Design Department,
Former Thrones, Demon
Adrammelech</b>

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:41.470
Well, aren't you attractive?

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:49.540
I'm in charge of any form 
of art within Pandemonium.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.800
Feel free to call me Lady Ad.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.760
Are you scared?

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.750
N-No, of course not.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.950
Pretty.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.290
Your...

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.820
Your eyes are so pretty, 
reflecting my image in them!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.080
Right.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:11.210
Oh dear, the length isn't right.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:13.200
And you're wearing slippers.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.400
My heels broke this morning.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.660
Well, that sounds terrible.

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:23.140
Mullin was with me, 
and he helped bring me here.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.680
Did you carry her like a princess?

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.300
Well, that's quite the perk.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.630
I'm the one who designed 
Her Highness's uniform.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.290
That was you?!

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.350
<i>He's got good taste.</i>

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:40.070
Don't worry about it.

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:41.360
I'll fix it.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.940
Thank you.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.820
I'm not used to walking like this.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:57.120
I normally can reach this...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.160
Do you want this one?

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.190
Thank you.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.040
Not at all.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:09.050
<i>Without my heels, Mullin seems much further...</i>

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:13.300
<i>With her heels, Her Highness 
looks much smaller...</i>

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.520
Y-Your Highness.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:16.260
What is it?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.710
It might be good for you 
to wear shorter heels.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:22.870
I don't wanna.

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:24.210
Huh?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:26.970
<i>Because then...</i>

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.740
<i>After waking up in the morning, 
she has to get ready.</i>

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.620
<i>She puts on her heels.</i>

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:44.100
<i>She stands tall.</i>

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.780
Good morning.

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:51.900
Good morning.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.520
Hm? What is it?

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.490
It's nothing.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:09.810
<i>With the heels, she can be closer 
to him and converse more easily.</i>

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:25.380
<i>A bright white light that rips 
through everything you see.</i>

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:32.590
<i>The lightning that the Lord sent forth 
cut through all the clouds beneath me,</i>

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.580
<i>causing me to fall from heaven.</i>

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:53.070
These are fluffier than the clouds...

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:58.530
<i>And I found myself in a place, in a sense,</i>

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.800
<i>more heavenly than heaven, 
after being cast down.</i>

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:07.620
<b>Her Highness's Secret.</b>

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:13.800
Okay!

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.150
Thank you.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:19.550
Your Highness, good work.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:25.140
Thirty-four points.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:28.850
<b>34 points</b>

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:28.850
<b>PR Mascot: Behemoth-tan</b>

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:27.200
Behe!

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:29.000
Surprisingly low.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.330
It's made from wool, 
but the strands are too thick.

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.920
They itch.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.610
I see.

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:38.940
<i>Her Highness today is doing an 
interview for </i>Weekly Demon<i>.</i>

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.400
That looks tough to wear.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.160
Would you like to try it on, Mullin-sama?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.330
N-No, I couldn't...

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.700
<i>Mullin wearing an animal suit...</i>

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.290
<b>Fluffy</b>

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:55.040
Your Highness, we're going to have 
today's meeting in the forest.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:57.260
<b>Fluffy</b>

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.920
Fluffy.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.600
<i>If you multiply two good things together, 
you get something extremely good.</i>

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.750
<i>My heart won't stop skipping a beat.</i>

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.020
<i>Hybrid heart skipping.</i>

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:10.520
In any event, Your Highness, 
I'll be starting the interview now.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:16.180
You can't talk about how fluffy things 
are or how lazy you want to be, okay?

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:17.730
Of course not.

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:21.610
It's an honor to be able to interview you.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:27.320
I was rather impressed with your project 
synopsis on your plan to make everyone in Hell,

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:29.200
and the greater Pandemonium 
area, feel welcome.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.110
Thank you very much!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.040
Weekly
Demon

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.250
So fluffy!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:36.800
It's so fluffy!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.050
<i>She was just impressed by the attachment.</i>

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:46.720
Well, next, could you tell us a little 
bit about how you spend your days off?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.810
I mostly read and watch movies.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.020
What genre, in specific?

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.980
Well, mostly animal documentaries.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:58.040
They live in the wilderness,

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:01.280
and seeing them like that makes me 
think about how I live my own life.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.040
I see!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:04.910
<i>She's watching for the fluffy stuff.</i>

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.320
Onto the next question.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:09.040
What do you like?

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:10.520
Flu...

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.500
Flu?

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:15.420
Flu...

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.280
Flurries.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.690
When you're in a flurry, you have 
to clear your mind and focus,

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.140
so that you can handle any situation calmly.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.670
I like how they force you to act that way.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.080
You're amazing, Your Highness!

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:32.560
You're rather hard on yourself!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:35.060
The exact type of person who should 
be in charge of a large organization!

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.020
I can't say anything...

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.530
Could I ask you what you dislike 
or can't really handle?

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:45.020
<i>I can't think of anything...</i>

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:46.820
<i>Maybe something not fluffy at all?</i>

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:48.990
There isn't anything.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.790
Huh? Nothing at all?

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:52.970
Yes.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:55.600
I wouldn't have expected anything less.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:59.590
Then, could I ask how you normally 
act in your office all day?

00:12:58.400 --> 00:12:59.590
<i>Your Highness...</i>

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:03.730
Good work, Your Highness.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:07.080
That was really tiring.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:10.680
Behemoth-tan wasn't as fluffy 
as I was hoping, either.

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.420
Yeah, but I was really impressed.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:16.320
You're rather good acting in public!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:17.770
Huh?

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:20.780
Couldn't you have worded that better?

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:22.230
Sorry.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.720
But you're impressive.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:31.070
I thought you were a quiet and relaxed 
person until I became your assistant.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:35.540
Anyway, let's go.

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:40.570
Um, Mullin...

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:47.880
Were you disappointed in me
when you became my assistant?

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.800
N-No...

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.240
Are you sure?

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.320
I'm glad...

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:58.410
Your Highness!

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:00.340
Our next appointment is at 5:00 PM!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:02.360
We have free time until then!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.030
I'm going to go check over 
the paperwork until then...

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:07.120
I see.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.990
Then, I'll take a break in the courtyard.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.090
Okay, I'll talk to you later!

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.090
<i>That got me worked up.</i>

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.670
<i>I said she was good at acting in public,</i>

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:25.490
<i>but knowing how laid back 
she really is in private,</i>

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.550
<i>kind of makes me feel that much 
closer to her. I like that.</i>

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.550
<i>Things I don't like...</i>

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.620
Her Highness is running late...

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.240
I hope she doesn't get soaked.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:58.750
Bro!

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:00.700
Are you heading out?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:01.710
Yeah.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:05.170
<i>I would expect him to have 
a cute umbrella like that.</i>

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:13.680
Where's Beelzebub?
Is she in her office?

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.880
No, she was taking a break in the courtyard.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.470
By herself?

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.470
Yes, probably.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:22.440
You should go find her immediately.

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:29.390
Your Highness!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:31.110
Your Highness!

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:32.790
<i>She's not here...</i>

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.740
<i>I hope I just didn't see her 
and she's back at the office.</i>

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:45.250
Your Highness!

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.080
There you are.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.160
You were trying not to get wet.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.720
I brought an umbrella.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.220
Anyway, let's head back.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:02.170
I'm sorry! We should put you in a dryer!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:03.900
What are you saying?

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.420
<i>He saw something he shouldn't have.</i>

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:14.150
What's the point of staying under 
here if you're already that soaked?

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.310
You should have just come back to the office.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.580
Just leave me alone.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.220
Could it be...

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.050
...that you're scared of lightning?

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.900
I'm not!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.880
You look pretty scared to me.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.460
I'm not!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.250
But you—

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:38.010
I'm not!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:41.220
<i>Arguing only dampens things further.</i>

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.570
You don't have to get so upset.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.540
I'm not scared...

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:54.650
A great demon of Pandemonium 
couldn't be scared of lightning...

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.330
<i>She's shaking...</i>

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.790
<i>She's really scared.</i>

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:03.220
<i>What should I do...</i>

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:04.730
<i>What should I do here?</i>

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.010
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to!

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:26.100
<i>She smiled.</i>

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.080
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.330
Why are you apologizing?!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:57.970
I'm sorry!

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.930
So you really are scared of lightning.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.580
When I was cast out of heaven,

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.680
there was lightning thrown right before me,

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.720
and now I just can't handle it.

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.940
Rather pathetic, isn't it?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.220
You can laugh at me.

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:20.410
I mean I'm sure you're 
disappointed in me now.

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:22.130
I wouldn't laugh at you!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.370
I'd be traumatized by something like that too.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.830
It's not pathetic at all!

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.380
Really?

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:31.580
Yeah.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.990
<i>I'm not disappointed...</i>

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:38.140
<i>I wonder if she'd get mad 
if I thought it was cute...</i>

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:41.130
Mullin...

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.270
Could you keep this a secret?

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.690
The lightning thing.

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.510
Of course.

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:51.880
I won't tell anyone.

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:58.290
It's our secret.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:06.690
Do you promise?

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.190
<i>I didn't expect that, though.</i>

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:34.200
<i>She seems like she'd be 
able to deal with anything,</i>

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.750
<i>but she's scared of lightning.</i>

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:42.070
Oh, yeah, you knew about her being 
scared of lightning, right?

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.700
Yeah. We've known
each other for a long time.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:51.620
What's wrong?

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.620
Nothing at all.

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.120
<i>I see...</i>

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:56.840
<i>I thought it was just a secret 
between the two of us, but...</i>

00:19:58.680 --> 00:19:59.340
<i>Hm?</i>

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:03.500
<i>Why am I disappointed?</i>

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:10.520
Your Highness, the magazine you did an 
interview with the other day has arrived.

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.810
Thank you very much.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.690
Weekly Demon

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.690
<b>July</b>

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.690
<b>Our wonderful leader of Pandemonium
Her Highness Beelzebub
Exclusive interview</b>

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:25.990
A short profile
She watches nature movies on her days off to relax.
She loves the strawberry daifuku at the Pandemonium store.
Her hobbies include reading and aromatherapy.
She doesn't have any real dislikes.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.680
That's a secret.

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:01.960
The first demon, Beelzebub!

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:04.460
<b>The First Demon</b>

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:04.460
<b>Beelzebub</b>

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.460
Roar!

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:11.390
Nothing beats fur.

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:14.350
Kind of a nice, wild feeling to it.

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:20.690
I guess you wouldn't wear 
underwear in primeval times...

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:24.880
Primeval underwear... 
I guess you'd use leaves?

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:27.080
Oh, maybe shells.

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:29.860
No, maybe you'd have animal 
hides for the underwear too?

00:22:29.860 --> 00:22:33.880
Actually, why do we wear underwear, anyway?

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:36.410
<b>Underwear</b>

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:34.770
<i>Underwear...</i>

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:36.410
<b>Gestaltzerfall</b>

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:36.410
<i>Gestaltzerfall.</i>

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:41.680
I love collecting a lot of things.

00:22:41.680 --> 00:22:43.250
Chestnuts are fun to collect,

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:44.960
but collecting anything from nuts, 
and even mushrooms is fun, too.

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:45.850
Oh, yeah.

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:48.830
It's fun collecting shells 
from the ocean, too.

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:49.860
Jump!

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:52.780
There's so many.

00:22:52.780 --> 00:22:54.390
I can eat this.

00:22:54.390 --> 00:22:55.960
I can't eat this.

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:57.560
I can eat this.

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:00.020
I... want to eat this.

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:01.230
Your Highness!

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:04.510
I've found a beautiful shell.

00:23:04.510 --> 00:23:05.710
Please have it.

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:06.850
You're giving it to me?

00:23:06.850 --> 00:23:08.040
Of course.

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:10.840
Thank you very much!

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:13.450
There's still plenty more over there!

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:14.560
Let's go.

00:23:14.560 --> 00:23:15.340
Sure!

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:25.200
<i>If I was born in primeval times...</i>

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:29.550
<i>I would spend all day collecting 
shells and chestnuts with Mullin.</i>

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:34.250
<i>Girls are cute when they're working hard.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>The Pandemonium Baths Are Great. You Should Visit.</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>I Want to Learn More...</b>

00:23:35.710 --> 00:23:37.760
<i>Please watch us next time.</i>
